{'user': [{'id': 1, 'text': 'I am 35 weeks pregnant and experiencing shortness of breath and pain and swelling on my left sides, especially my leg'}], 'bot': [{'id': 1, 'text': 'Please note that I am an AI model and not a medical professional, therefore my advice should not be taken as a diagnosis. If you are experiencing any symptoms that are concerning you, you should consult a medical professional.

